[size=4][b]📖 About This Mod / نبذة عن المود[/b][/size]
This mod brings a complete, high-quality Arabic localization to [b]The Last of Us Part I[/b] on PC, created by [b]Mohamed Moslem Allouch[/b].
Unlike previous attempts or raw font ports that suffer from broken letter joins, 1-pixel seams, or resetting back to English on game restarts, this mod features a custom binary engine patch and dual-slot localization that keeps your Arabic subtitles active permanently!

تعريب متكامل وعالي الجودة للعبة The Last of Us Part I على الكمبيوتر من إعداد [b]Mohamed Moslem Allouch[/b]. تم حل جميع مشاكل تقطيع الحروف العربية والفواصل بين الحروف المتصلة بالكامل، مع ثبات دائم للترجمة العربية دون أن تعود للإنجليزية عند إعادة تشغيل اللعبة!

[line]

[size=4][b]✨ Features / المميزات[/b][/size]
[list]
[*] [b]Permanent Arabic Subtitles (No Resetting on Restart):[/b] Automatically active on boot. Both English (US) and French slots load Arabic subtitles, ensuring your game never reverts to English dialogue when restarted.
[*] [b]Seamless Cursive Arabic Script:[/b] Custom font engine rendering ensures all Arabic letters connect naturally without vertical cuts, gaps, or seams.
[*] [b]Full Narrative Subtitles:[/b] Every story cutscene and narrative dialogue translated with high precision.
[*] [b]Ambient & Combat Dialogue:[/b] Background conversations, enemy callouts, and systemic subtitles translated into Arabic.
[*] [b]Document & Note Reader:[/b] All collectible notes, letters, and diary entries appear in clean Arabic when pressing the 'Read' button.
[*] [b]Speaker Name Preservation:[/b] English character names remain cleanly aligned on the far right (e.g. [Dialogue] :SARAH).
[*] [b]Pristine English UI & Stability:[/b] Main menus, settings, and HUD remain in original English to ensure 100% stability and avoid memory pool crashes.
[*] [b]1-Click Standalone Installer:[/b] Comes with an automated, ultra-fast self-contained installer executable with auto-detection and folder browser window support. No Python or command-line knowledge required.
[*] [b]Safe with Automatic Backups:[/b] Automatically backs up your original game files before installation and supports 1-click uninstallation at any time.
[/list]

