[size=4][b]📥 Installation Guide / طريقة التثبيت[/b][/size]
[b]For Option 1 (1-Click Installer):[/b]
[list=1]
[*] Download [b]The_Last_of_Us_Part_I_Arabic_Mod_v1.0.zip[/b] from the GitHub Release link above.
[*] Extract and run [b]TLOU_Arabic_Mod_Installer.exe[/b].
[*] Press [b][1][/b] to install. It automatically creates backups and patches the game in ~30 seconds.
[*] Launch the game—subtitles and notes are active immediately!
[/list]

[b]For Option 2 (Nexus Package with Python):[/b]
[list=1]
[*] Download and extract the archive from the [b]Files[/b] tab.
[*] Double-click [b]Install_Arabic_Mod.py[/b] (or run [c]python Install_Arabic_Mod.py[/c] in terminal).
[*] Press [b][1][/b] to install.
[*] Launch the game!
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b]🗑️ Uninstallation / طريقة الحذف[/b][/size]
Run [b]TLOU_Arabic_Mod_Installer.exe[/b] and choose Option [b][2][/b]. Your original files will be restored instantly.

